 <div class="ar-line"><span class="ar-title">بالمصري:</span> القسم ده بيساعدك تفتكر شكل كل Topology والفرق بين المصطلحات المتشابهة بدل ما تحفظ الكلام بس.</div>
 <h3>Network topology diagrams</h3>
 <div class="topology-grid">
  <article class="diagram-card"><h3>Mesh</h3><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 240 125"><g><line x1="45" y1="25" x2="195" y2="25"/><line x1="45" y1="25" x2="45" y2="100"/><line x1="45" y1="25" x2="195" y2="100"/><line x1="195" y1="25" x2="45" y2="100"/><line x1="195" y1="25" x2="195" y2="100"/><line x1="45" y1="100" x2="195" y2="100"/></g><circle cx="45" cy="25" r="8"/><circle cx="195" cy="25" r="8"/><circle cx="45" cy="100" r="8"/><circle cx="195" cy="100" r="8"/></svg><p>Every node has direct links to the other nodes in a fully connected mesh.</p><span class="ar-small">كل جهاز متوصل مباشرة بباقي الأجهزة؛ كابلات وتكلفة أكتر.</span></article>
  <article class="diagram-card"><h3>Star</h3><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 240 125"><g><line x1="120" y1="62" x2="35" y2="22"/><line x1="120" y1="62" x2="205" y2="22"/><line x1="120" y1="62" x2="35" y2="103"/><line x1="120" y1="62" x2="205" y2="103"/><line x1="120" y1="62" x2="120" y2="15"/></g><rect x="108" y="50" width="24" height="24" rx="5" fill="#70e1c1"/><circle cx="35" cy="22" r="7"/><circle cx="205" cy="22" r="7"/><circle cx="35" cy="103" r="7"/><circle cx="205" cy="103" r="7"/><circle cx="120" cy="15" r="7"/></svg><p>All devices connect to one central controller.</p><span class="ar-small">كل الأجهزة متوصلة بجهاز مركزي؛ لو المركزي عطل الشبكة كلها تتأثر.</span></article>
  <article class="diagram-card"><h3>Bus</h3><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 240 125"><line x1="18" y1="68" x2="222" y2="68"/><g><line x1="45" y1="68" x2="45" y2="25"/><line x1="95" y1="68" x2="95" y2="25"/><line x1="145" y1="68" x2="145" y2="25"/><line x1="195" y1="68" x2="195" y2="25"/></g><circle cx="45" cy="22" r="7"/><circle cx="95" cy="22" r="7"/><circle cx="145" cy="22" r="7"/><circle cx="195" cy="22" r="7"/></svg><p>One backbone cable connects all nodes through drop lines and taps.</p><span class="ar-small">كابل رئيسي واحد وكل جهاز بيتوصل بيه عن طريق وصلة فرعية.</span></article>
  <article class="diagram-card"><h3>Ring</h3><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 240 125"><path d="M120 18 L190 62 L120 106 L50 62 Z"/><circle cx="120" cy="18" r="8"/><circle cx="190" cy="62" r="8"/><circle cx="120" cy="106" r="8"/><circle cx="50" cy="62" r="8"/></svg><p>Each device connects to its two neighbors; the slide describes one-way signal flow.</p><span class="ar-small">كل جهاز متوصل باللي جنبه، والإشارة بتلف في اتجاه واحد حسب المحاضرة.</span></article>
  <article class="diagram-card"><h3>Tree</h3><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 240 125"><g><line x1="120" y1="18" x2="65" y2="60"/><line x1="120" y1="18" x2="175" y2="60"/><line x1="65" y1="60" x2="35" y2="103"/><line x1="65" y1="60" x2="95" y2="103"/><line x1="175" y1="60" x2="145" y2="103"/><line x1="175" y1="60" x2="205" y2="103"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="18" r="8"/><circle cx="65" cy="60" r="8"/><circle cx="175" cy="60" r="8"/><circle cx="35" cy="103" r="7"/><circle cx="95" cy="103" r="7"/><circle cx="145" cy="103" r="7"/><circle cx="205" cy="103" r="7"/></svg><p>A hierarchical structure with a central trunk and single paths.</p><span class="ar-small">شكل هرمي؛ فيه عقدة رئيسية وفروع متفرعة منها.</span></article>
  <article class="diagram-card"><h3>Hybrid</h3><svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 240 125"><g><line x1="120" y1="62" x2="45" y2="62"/><line x1="120" y1="62" x2="195" y2="62"/><line x1="25" y1="35" x2="65" y2="35"/><line x1="25" y1="90" x2="65" y2="90"/><line x1="175" y1="35" x2="215" y2="35"/><line x1="175" y1="90" x2="215" y2="90"/><line x1="25" y1="35" x2="25" y2="90"/><line x1="65" y1="35" x2="65" y2="90"/><line x1="175" y1="35" x2="175" y2="90"/><line x1="215" y1="35" x2="215" y2="90"/></g><rect x="109" y="51" width="22" height="22" rx="4" fill="#70e1c1"/><circle cx="25" cy="35" r="6"/><circle cx="65" cy="35" r="6"/><circle cx="25" cy="90" r="6"/><circle cx="65" cy="90" r="6"/><circle cx="175" cy="35" r="6"/><circle cx="215" cy="35" r="6"/><circle cx="175" cy="90" r="6"/><circle cx="215" cy="90" r="6"/></svg><p>A combination of two or more topology types in connected sub-networks.</p><span class="ar-small">دمج أكتر من نوع Topology في شبكة واحدة.</span></article>
 </div>
 <h3>Topology comparison</h3>
 <div class="table-wrap"><table class="compare"><thead><tr><th>Topology</th><th>Structure</th><th>Advantages in slides</th><th>Disadvantages in slides</th></tr></thead><tbody>
 <tr><td><b>Mesh</b></td><td>Direct links between every pair</td><td>Many direct paths between devices</td><td>Difficult installation/reconfiguration; much wiring; expensive hardware</td></tr>
 <tr><td><b>Star</b></td><td>All nodes connect to central controller</td><td>Easy install; one link failure isolated; easy fault identification</td><td>Central controller failure can stop whole network; more cable than ring/tree</td></tr>
 <tr><td><b>Bus</b></td><td>One backbone with drop lines/taps</td><td>Easy installation; less cabling than mesh/star/tree</td><td>Harder fault isolation; backbone break stops all transmission</td></tr>
 <tr><td><b>Ring</b></td><td>Each node connects to two neighbors</td><td>Relatively easy install/reconfigure; add/remove requires two connections; fault isolation simplified</td><td>Break can disable network; one-way flow in lecture description</td></tr>
 <tr><td><b>Tree</b></td><td>Hierarchical trunk and branches</td><td>Clear hierarchy and paths</td><td>Specific advantages/disadvantages not enumerated in the uploaded slides</td></tr>
 <tr><td><b>Hybrid</b></td><td>Combination of topologies</td><td>Can combine subnetworks with different designs</td><td>Specific advantages/disadvantages not enumerated in the uploaded slides</td></tr>
 </tbody></table></div>
 <div class="ar-line"><span class="ar-title">خد بالك:</span> المميزات والعيوب المكتوبة هنا مقتبسة من المحاضرة. مش هنخترع مميزات أو عيوب للـ Tree والـ Hybrid لأنها مش متفصلة في السلايدز.</div>
 <h3>Must-know comparisons</h3>
 <div class="table-wrap"><table class="compare"><thead><tr><th>Compare</th><th>First term</th><th>Second term</th><th>Quick memory</th></tr></thead><tbody>
 <tr><td>Packet vs Circuit Switching</td><td>Messages split into packets; shared links</td><td>End-to-end resources reserved for a call</td><td>Packets share; circuits reserve</td></tr>
 <tr><td>FDM vs TDM</td><td>Different frequency bands</td><td>Different time slots</td><td>Frequency vs Time</td></tr>
 <tr><td>Forwarding vs Routing</td><td>Local action: move packet from input to output link</td><td>Network-wide process: determine paths</td><td>Forwarding = this router; Routing = path planning</td></tr>
 <tr><td>Transmission vs Propagation Delay</td><td>L/R: push bits onto link</td><td>d/s: signal travel along medium</td><td>Sending time vs travel time</td></tr>
 <tr><td>Guided vs Unguided Media</td><td>Solid medium: copper/coax/fiber</td><td>Free propagation: radio</td><td>Wire/fiber vs air/radio</td></tr>
 <tr><td>TCP vs UDP</td><td>Both are transport protocols; the Chapter 1 slides name them but do not detail their service differences</td><td>Both are transport protocols; detailed comparison is not specified in these slides</td><td>Know layer and examples; don't infer extra details from these slides</td></tr>
 </tbody></table></div>
 <div class="ar-line"><span class="ar-title">بالمصري:</span> Forwarding حركة الباكيت جوه الراوتر نفسه، Routing تحديد الطريق اللي الباكيت هتمشي فيه. Transmission وقت ضخ البتات على السلك، Propagation وقت سفر الإشارة في السلك.</div>
</section>

<section class="content" id="calculators">
 <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Formula Lab</h2><p>Enter values and calculate the formulas shown in your lecture slides.</p></div></div>
 <div class="ar-line"><span class="ar-title">بالمصري:</span> حط الأرقام والوحدات صح، والأداة هتحسبلك النتيجة. خلي بالك: لازم L بالـ bits وR بالـ bits/sec وd بالمتر وs بالمتر/ثانية.</div>
 <div class="tool-grid">
  <div class="tool-card"><h3>1. Transmission delay</h3><p class="small-note">Formula: d<sub>trans</sub> = L / R</p>
   <label>Packet length L (bits)</label><input id="calcL" type="number" min="0" value="10000">
   <label>Link rate R (bits/second)</label><input id="calcR" type="number" min="0" value="100000000">
   <button class="btn primary" onclick="calcTransmission()">Calculate</button><div class="result" id="transResult">Example result: 0.0001 seconds = 0.1 ms</div>
   <span class="ar-small">زمن الإرسال = حجم الباكيت بالبت ÷ سرعة الوصلة بالبت/ثانية.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-card"><h3>2. Propagation delay</h3><p class="small-note">Formula: d<sub>prop</sub> = d / s</p>
   <label>Link distance d (meters)</label><input id="calcD" type="number" min="0" value="200000">
   <label>Propagation speed s (meters/second)</label><input id="calcS" type="number" min="0" value="200000000">
   <button class="btn primary" onclick="calcPropagation()">Calculate</button><div class="result" id="propResult">Example result: 0.001 seconds = 1 ms</div>
   <span class="ar-small">زمن الانتشار = المسافة ÷ سرعة انتشار الإشارة.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-card"><h3>3. Traffic intensity</h3><p class="small-note">Formula: ρ = L × a / R</p>
   <label>Packet length L (bits)</label><input id="trafficL" type="number" min="0" value="10000">
   <label>Average arrival rate a (packets/second)</label><input id="trafficA" type="number" min="0" value="100">
   <label>Link rate R (bits/second)</label><input id="trafficR" type="number" min="0" value="1000000">
   <button class="btn primary" onclick="calcTraffic()">Calculate</button><div class="result" id="trafficResult">Example result: ρ = 1.0</div>
   <span class="ar-small">كل ما القيمة تقرب من 1، الانتظار بيزيد. لو أكبر من 1 يبقى الحمل أعلى من قدرة الوصلة حسب نموذج السلايد.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-card"><h3>4. Mesh channels</h3><p class="small-note">Formula: n(n − 1) / 2</p>
   <label>Number of devices n</label><input id="meshN" type="number" min="2" step="1" value="5">
   <button class="btn primary" onclick="calcMesh()">Calculate</button><div class="result" id="meshResult">Example result: 10 physical channels</div>
   <span class="ar-small">عدد الوصلات في Mesh كاملة = عدد الأجهزة × (عدد الأجهزة - 1) ÷ 2.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-card"><h3>5. End-to-end throughput</h3><p class="small-note">Simple path: min(Rs, Rc). Shared bottleneck scenario: min(Rc, Rs, R/10).</p>
   <label>Server access rate Rs (Mbps)</label><input id="rs" type="number" min="0" value="100">
   <label>Client access rate Rc (Mbps)</label><input id="rc" type="number" min="0" value="50">
   <label>Shared backbone R (Mbps) — optional scenario</label><input id="backbone" type="number" min="0" value="200">
   <button class="btn primary" onclick="calcThroughput()">Calculate</button><div class="result" id="throughputResult">Example: min(100, 50, 200/10) = 20 Mbps</div>
   <span class="ar-small">السرعة النهائية بتتحدد بأقل وصلة مؤثرة. في مثال 10 اتصالات بنحسب نصيب الاتصال R/10.</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tool-card"><h3>6. Total nodal delay</h3><p class="small-note">d<sub>nodal</sub> = d<sub>proc</sub> + d<sub>queue</sub> + d<sub>trans</sub> + d<sub>prop</sub></p>
   <label>Processing delay (ms)</label><input id="dp" type="number" min="0" value="1">
   <label>Queueing delay (ms)</label><input id="dq" type="number" min="0" value="2">
   <label>Transmission delay (ms)</label><input id="dt" type="number" min="0" value="0.1">
   <label>Propagation delay (ms)</label><input id="dpr" type="number" min="0" value="1">
   <button class="btn primary" onclick="calcNodal()">Calculate</button><div class="result" id="nodalResult">Example result: 4.1 ms</div>
   <span class="ar-small">اجمع الأربع أنواع من التأخير عشان تجيب إجمالي Nodal Delay.</span>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

